expected = "Uncertain payments must remain recoverable while finalized journal evidence has an explicit retention/compaction policy coordinated with the replay window."
proposal = "Add finality-aware retention in services/interop/crates/layerx-interop-service/src/relay.rs. Preserve unresolved claims and compact finalized entries to safe replay tombstones coordinated with gateway retention; prove reopen and late replay cannot cause another debit."
